        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Saget, S. Shankar, Sujatha Rangarajan\n- Films: Enthiran\n- Roles: comedian, actor, television host, film director, producer, writer\n- Topics: Tamil cinema, science fiction film\n\nFacts:\n- Bob Saget was born on May 17, 1956, and he is an American stand-up comedian, actor, and television host.\n- S. Shankar was born on August 17, 1963, as Shankar Shanmugam, and he is an Indian film director and producer who predominantly works in Tamil cinema.\n- Enthiran is a 2010 Indian Tamil-language science fiction film.\n- S. Shankar directed Enthiran.\n- S. Shankar and Sujatha Rangarajan co-wrote Enthiran.",
